{"title":"Creative Technologist Roadmap","role":"Creative Technologist","summary":"A Creative Technologist combines software engineering, design, digital media, interaction design, and emerging technologies to create innovative digital experiences.","facts":{"Current degree":"B.Tech / B.E. (Bachelor of Technology / Engineering)","Course":"Computer Science & Design (CSD)"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Career Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A Creative Technologist combines software engineering, design, digital media, interaction design, and emerging technologies to create innovative digital experiences."},{"type":"p","text":"The role sits at the intersection of:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Computer science"},{"text":"UI/UX design"},{"text":"Creative coding"},{"text":"Interactive technology"},{"text":"Digital media"},{"text":"Generative AI"},{"text":"3D and immersive experiences"},{"text":"Human-computer interaction"},{"text":"Product innovation"}]},{"type":"p","text":"A Creative Technologist may build interactive websites, generative experiences, digital installations, AR/VR prototypes, AI-powered creative tools, experimental interfaces, or technology-driven brand experiences."}]},{"heading":"Career Horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"flow","items":["B.Tech – Computer Science & Design","Creative Technologist / Creative Developer","Interaction Designer / Creative Developer","Senior Creative Technologist","Technical Experience Designer / Innovation Engineer","Creative Technology Lead","Creative Technology Director / Experience Technology Lead"]},{"type":"p","text":"Other pathways include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"UX Engineer"},{"text":"Interaction Designer"},{"text":"Design Technologist"},{"text":"Generative AI Creative Developer"},{"text":"XR Developer"},{"text":"Creative Coding Specialist"},{"text":"Digital Experience Engineer"},{"text":"Prototyping Engineer"},{"text":"Innovation Technol